 tũtambuurangwo nĩ magego mao.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"text":"Ithuĩ tũhonokete ta nyoni","poem":1},{"text":"ĩhonokete mũtego-inĩ wa mũmĩtegi;","poem":2},{"text":"mũtego nĩunangĩtwo,","poem":1},{"text":"na ithuĩ nĩtũhonokete.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Ũteithio witũ uumaga harĩ Jehova,","poem":1},{"text":"o we Mũũmbi wa igũrũ na thĩ.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/124.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/125.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/kik_bib/PSA/123.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}